From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shawn-makes-stuff <shawn.rains@rocketmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:58:48 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] rusticc: the logs name the server Moonruster

Human-readable log, warning and message texts that name the running
server say Moonruster, and 'See moonraker.log' points at moonruster.log
(the init's log file). Identifiers stay Moonraker's: moonraker.conf,
moonraker.sock, the moonraker service, database namespaces, the JWT
audience, client_info/user agent, zeroconf/SSDP names, the
/server/files/moonraker.log endpoint and texts about Moonraker's docs
or its Python plugin API.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017xQsBSvb6emYLfnWCbF3jA
